recommend check-in (Keaton) -- three questions wait on your word, none agent-doable. The run record has no field saying whether a pass ran before staging or after it, so nothing tells an obedient lap from a skipped one; a hot yes|no costs one word per row, and eight ships run the file that would write it. Nothing checks any guard's watch-set against the paths its scan actually opens, and the one that bit here derives its second path rather than spelling it, which is the case such a meter would be blind to. And the several-line interleave in the weave still wants an anchor per insert, which widens Diff.
